    "title": "Iowa State basketball falls at buzzer vs Arizona in Big 12 semifinals",
    "text": "ISU BASKETBALLIowa State basketball falls to Arizona, notable numbers for Cyclones Eugene RapayDes Moines RegisterUpdated March 13, 2026, 10:15 p.m. CTKANSAS CITY, Mo. — Wait, that was only the Big 12 Tournament final four?In a battle of NCAA Tournament contenders and top-10 teams that came down to wire with each exchanged shot surpassing the magnitude of the last one, Arizona's Jaden Bradley had the final say.With Iowa State's Killyan Toure draped all over him and the clock winding down, Bradley hit a difficult game-winning jumper from the right side to lift the Wildcats to victory and the Big 12 Tournament title game.",
